    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u3010Outline\u3011</strong><br>&quot;Sword Smash&quot; is an exhilarating TopDown 2D action game where you defeat many enemies and progress through the stages. The objective is to control the player and defeat numerous monsters and bosses. Each stage features a variety of monsters, and the game is cleared by defeating all of the bosses in each stage.<br><br><strong>\u3010Features\u3011</strong><br>\u30fbNormal attack is done by left-clicking. You can only attack as long as you have &quot;stamina&quot;.<br><br>\u30fbBy collecting &quot;mana&quot;, you can activate powerful special attacks. Even enemies that take a long time to defeat with normal attacks can be taken down quickly with special attacks.<br><br>\u30fbDefeating enemies earns you experience points. Let's strengthen the player with level-up bonuses.<br><br>\u30fbMany monsters appear, and defeating a certain number of them will summon a boss. Defeating the boss and touching the clear portal that appears will clear the stage, allowing you to proceed to the next stage.<br><br><strong>\u3010Operation method\u3011</strong><br>\u30fbRight-click: Normal attack<br>\u30fbLeft-click: Special attack<br>\u30fbMovement: WASD keys<br>\u30fbMouse cursor: Selects level-up bonuses.",
